"{\"blocks\":[{\"k\":\"t\",\"v\":\"For January 15 from SFO to BKK, the selected results offer a faster economy award option and a separate-ticket business-class option. There is no selected Cost-category journey.\"},{\"k\":\"p\",\"r\":\"J1@2027-01-15T23:15-08:00/SFO>BKK/E>2027-01-17T10:35\",\"n\":\"Faster Aeroplan economy award via HKG\",\"v\":\"Consider this for the shorter trip among these choices: it takes about 20 hours and arrives earlier than the business option. The tradeoff is economy rather than business.\"},{\"k\":\"p\",\"r\":\"J82@2027-01-15T10:13-08:00/SFO>BKK/B>2027-01-17T15:05\",\"n\":\"Turkish business award from LAX, with separate SFO–LAX positioning\",\"v\":\"Consider this for the business cabin. Its tradeoffs are a much longer trip, including a long IST connection, and a separate SFO–LAX booking; the award-seat evidence and protection between tickets are unknown.\"},{\"k\":\"t\",\"v\":\"The Aeroplan quote is 65,000 points plus CAD 107.40 in taxes, while the Turkish quote is 275,000 points with taxes unavailable in the source. These are different programs, and the quote scopes are unknown, so the points are not directly comparable. Neither selected journey has a complete trip price; the separate positioning fare also does not establish the award trip’s total cost.\"},{\"k\":\"b\",\"r\":\"C1@2027-01-15T09:40-08:00/SFO>BKK\",\"n\":\"SFO–BKK cash benchmark\",\"v\":\"The search results quote USD 440 for SFO–BKK, but the price scope is unknown.\"}]}"
